{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-gk3-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn GK3 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn GK3 pod kit is a pocket-friendly vape, ideal for new and seasoned vapers alike. It contains a built-in 900mAh battery, which offers plenty of vaping before needing to be recharged. Delivering a 5-25W power output range, the GK3 is a solid option for both MTL (Mouth To Lung) and RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) vaping. This kit is compatible with the refillable Caliburn G3 pods and two 2ml pods are also included to help get you started.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e900mAh Built-In Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5-25W Output Range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL And RDTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInhale Activation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVariable Wattage Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml Refillable Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop-Filling Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe GK3 boasts single-button operation and you can get started with five quick clicks. When unlocked, vape by either pressing the button or just inhaling on the mouthpiece. The device’s smart, built-in chipset recognises your coil’s resistance and selects the best power output automatically, helping your pods last longer and removing the need for any guesswork. If you’re looking for extra customisation, you can also set a power level manually and discover your perfect vape. However you decide to vape, keep track of power and battery life easily with the GK3’s built-in OLED display.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Caliburn G3 pods hold up to 2ml of e-liquid and boast a simple top-filling design. Refilling your pod is as easy as lifting off the mouthpiece — you don’t even have to remove it from your device, cutting down on a lot of mess. Their built-in coil design saves you even more hassle, as you can just replace the whole pod when the coil inside needs changing. Want to switch between an RDTL and MTL inhale? Simply swap between the 0.6 Ohm and 0.9 Ohm pods, both of which will work best 50% VG e-liquids and higher PG vape juice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCaliburn GK3 Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6 Ohm Caliburn G3 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9 Ohm Caliburn G3 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673630875703,"sku":"U Cali GK3 Pod System","price":4850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/caliburn-gk3-kit-min.jpg?v=1747872218","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-gk3-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




